<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0A1A7;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;">#   * After 300 seconds (5 minutes) if at least 100 changes were performed</span></span>
